{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/101134","id":2260488757,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6GvFI1","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101134","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101134.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101134.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101134","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/101134/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/101134/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101134/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/df8fc1a1415035d32734184c9f00b57d748e9aae","number":101134,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Use rstrings for embedded binary files instead of comma-separated numbers.","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"This decreases the header size and makes it faster to parse.\r\n\r\nIn an initial test, this shaved off about 13s of CPU build time from `test_main.cpp` (61s to 48s).\r\nThe files are about half the size as before (e.g. 16mb to 8mb for `builtin_fonts.gen.h`).\r\nNapkin math suggests about 40s of CPU time and 25mb of file size are saved in total.\r\n\r\nIt did not substantially reduce the overall build time of Godot.\r\n\r\n### Caveats\r\nRaw strings can be terminated. Randomly encountering the terminator `)~~~~\"` in a binary file is _pretty unlikely_, but it could happen. Since all embedded files are deterministic (afaik), this is a static problem and should be caught if changes to the files are made that would trigger this problem.\r\n\r\nA better solution would be to embed the files using binary embedding tools, or c++23' `#embed`, but this would be substantially more effort.","labels":[{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2025-01-04T18:30:39Z","updated_at":"2025-01-04T19:56:55Z","closed_at":"2025-01-04T19:48:23Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"a58e563c5690130902e670fe5124a7a323ad8c94","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"Ivorforce:binary-file-rstrings","ref":"binary-file-rstrings","repo":{"id":861387944,"node_id":"R_kgDOM1e8qA","name":"godot","full_name":"Ivorforce/godot","owner":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/use